133
00:11:07,659 --> 00:11:08,340
Mom.

134
00:11:10,179 --> 00:11:10,860
Dad.

135
00:11:11,899 --> 00:11:12,580
Mom.

136
00:11:35,879 --> 00:11:36,700
Mother,

137
00:11:37,299 --> 00:11:38,279
