146
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:17,519
Young Master.

147
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:01,279
Young Master.

148
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:03,200
Even if Xueting

149
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:04,639
really wrote that report,

150
00:16:05,299 --> 00:16:07,100
