176
00:17:33,059 --> 00:17:33,380
Des...

177
00:17:33,380 --> 00:17:34,140
Despicable.

178
00:17:34,819 --> 00:17:35,680
Shameless.

179
00:17:36,599 --> 00:17:37,380
Filthy.

180
00:17:38,359 --> 00:17:39,240
What else?

181
00:17:41,559 --> 00:17:42,400
I'll take it all.

182
00:17:51,140 --> 00:17:52,140
If I want something,

183
00:17:54,839 --> 00:17:56,319
