186
00:18:31,519 --> 00:18:32,299
Yeah.

187
00:18:37,420 --> 00:18:38,420
I'm insane.

188
00:18:44,220 --> 00:18:45,400
From the day I found

189
00:18:45,400 --> 00:18:46,579
