200
00:19:33,380 --> 00:19:35,579
Don't think I'm easy to push around.

201
00:19:36,220 --> 00:19:37,980
You are the one who won't let go.

202
00:19:39,420 --> 00:19:40,680
Treat others the way you want to be treated.

203
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:41,539
Don't you get it?

204
00:19:43,799 --> 00:19:45,779
Don't get smart with me.

205
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:49,220
I don't care about your philosophy.

206
00:19:52,980 --> 00:19:54,019
I only know,

207
00:19:54,859 --> 00:19:56,420
you're in my head

208
00:19:56,420 --> 00:19:57,700
