209
00:20:07,319 --> 00:20:07,920
Let go.

210
00:20:08,160 --> 00:20:08,940
Shameless.

211
00:20:17,059 --> 00:20:17,859
Fine. Then I'll

212
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:20,319
