233
00:22:56,700 --> 00:22:58,319
One with equality, respect.

234
00:22:58,900 --> 00:23:00,220
A wholehearted love.

235
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:03,599
Love?

236
00:23:05,359 --> 00:23:06,700
You're too naive.

237
00:23:08,140 --> 00:23:09,980
Even now you still don't get it.

238
00:23:11,019 --> 00:23:12,279
In this world,

239
00:23:12,859 --> 00:23:14,099
