245
00:23:32,140 --> 00:23:33,680
Listen up, Ye Pingjun.

246
00:23:34,339 --> 00:23:35,460
Whether you like it or not,

247
00:23:37,660 --> 00:23:39,240
I want you, and you only!

248
00:24:39,680 --> 00:24:40,480
Jin,

249
00:24:41,660 --> 00:24:42,680
pull harder, and

250
00:24:42,859 --> 00:24:44,180
you're gonna yank my arm off.

251
00:24:47,059 --> 00:24:49,200
One wound after another.

252
00:24:50,079 --> 00:24:51,420
That old one split

253
00:24:51,940 --> 00:24:53,019
open again.

254
00:24:53,400 --> 00:24:54,480
Turned into a hole.

255
00:24:55,480 --> 00:24:56,640
Almost hit the bone.

256
00:24:59,599 --> 00:25:00,039
Who's the girl

257
00:25:00,039 --> 00:25:01,039
that broke your heart?

258
00:25:04,160 --> 00:25:05,279
Whatever.

259
00:25:06,299 --> 00:25:07,339
Yu men

260
00:25:08,140 --> 00:25:09,839
