261
00:25:22,900 --> 00:25:23,859
Don't get the wound wet.

262
00:25:24,440 --> 00:25:25,599
I'll come check tomorrow.

263
00:25:28,839 --> 00:25:29,559
Rest up.

264
00:25:40,140 --> 00:25:40,740
See you, Mr. Jin.

265
00:25:40,740 --> 00:25:41,200
See you.

266
00:25:47,220 --> 00:25:47,700
Salute.

267
00:25:51,079 --> 00:25:51,759
