279
00:26:20,960 --> 00:26:21,519
Go. Leave.

280
00:26:22,000 --> 00:26:22,480
Officer...

281
00:26:22,480 --> 00:26:23,299
That spy will be

282
00:26:23,500 --> 00:26:24,740
