283
00:26:25,119 --> 00:26:25,980
You can collect the body then.

284
00:26:26,240 --> 00:26:26,940
No visitor's allowed.

285
00:28:06,339 --> 00:28:06,940
Mother.

286
00:28:10,660 --> 00:28:11,460
Pingjun.

287
00:28:12,759 --> 00:28:14,059
Did you see Xueting?

288
00:28:16,839 --> 00:28:17,640
No.

289
00:28:26,220 --> 00:28:27,019
How...

290
00:28:27,720 --> 00:28:29,940
