293
00:28:39,720 --> 00:28:41,460
What sentence will he get?

294
00:28:44,619 --> 00:28:45,720
Tell me.

295
00:28:50,140 --> 00:28:51,960
Just tell me.

296
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:56,920
If...

297
00:28:57,160 --> 00:28:58,660
