00:29:15,039 --> 00:29:15,579
Mother!

303
00:29:17,839 --> 00:29:18,460
Mother!

304
00:29:18,720 --> 00:29:19,099
Mother!

305
00:29:19,259 --> 00:29:20,680
Don't scare me, mother!

306
00:29:20,839 --> 00:29:21,599
Mother!

307
00:29:22,539 --> 00:29:24,140
Please don't scare me!

308
00:29:24,400 --> 00:29:24,779
Mother!

309
00:29:24,940 --> 00:29:26,119
Don't scare me, mother!

310
00:29:26,940 --> 00:29:27,339
Mother!

311
00:29:29,440 --> 00:29:30,380
What's with you?

312
00:29:30,380 --> 00:29:31,279
Hurry, walk faster.

313
00:29:31,279 --> 00:29:32,440
Nanny, don't drag me.

314
00:29:32,940 --> 00:29:34,339
This is a matter of life and death.

315
00:29:34,339 --> 00:29:35,740
Why can't you make one house call?

316
00:29:35,839 --> 00:29:36,740
Go check again.

317
00:29:36,740 --> 00:29:37,660
That poor girl Pingjun

318
00:29:37,660 --> 00:29:38,599
cried herself sick.

319
00:29:38,940 --> 00:29:40,119
It's not that I won't go.

320
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:42,039
I told you, I can't treat it.

321
00:29:42,279 --> 00:29:42,900
Her mother needs

322
00:29:43,019 --> 00:29:43,980
to go to a foreign-run

323
00:29:43,980 --> 00:29:44,440
hospital.

324
00:29:44,700 --> 00:29:46,059
I ran out of options already.

325
00:29:46,859 --> 00:29:48,200
They only have each other.

326
00:29:48,240 --> 00:29:49,660
And her son-in-law's been arrested.

327
00:29:49,660 --> 00:29:50,480
Come on.

328
00:29:50,640 --> 00:29:51,960
Just do a good deed.

329
00:29:52,019 --> 00:29:53,039
Go take a look.

330
00:29:53,220 --> 00:29:54,900
It's about someone's life. Hurry.

331
00:29:55,099 --> 00:29:56,680
Pingjun, Pingjun.

332
00:29:56,779 --> 00:29:57,839
The doctor's here.

333
00:29:58,660 --> 00:29:59,880
I told you, I can't treat it.

334
00:29:59,880 --> 00:30:00,980
Don't put me on the spot.

335
00:30:01,140 --> 00:30:01,599
I...

336
00:30:02,880 --> 00:30:03,619
Who are you people?

337
00:30:04,519 --> 00:30:05,480
You can't go inside.

338
00:30:05,500 --> 00:30:07,200
You can't go in. Stop.

339
00:30:07,859 --> 00:30:08,680
Stop.

340
00:30:11,579 --> 00:30:12,039
Mother.

341
00:30:18,740 --> 00:30:19,539
Director Gu.

342
00:30:20,279 --> 00:30:21,599
What are you doing here?

343
00:30:22,640 --> 00:30:23,960
Your mother has to go

344
00:30:24,559 --> 00:30:25,680
to a hospital.

345
00:30:33,160 --> 00:30:33,960
If you don't trust me,

346
00:30:34,599 --> 00:30:35,720
you can come along.

347
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:38,359
Kindness or ill intent, you'll find out

348
00:30:38,779 --> 00:30:39,539
soon enough.

349
00:31:23,240 --> 00:31:23,940
The doctor says

350
00:31:24,920 --> 00:31:26,279
your mother's condition is stable for now.

351
00:31:27,119 --> 00:31:28,059
I've told the hospital to

352
00:31:28,240 --> 00:31:29,380
give her the best care.

353
00:31:31,059 --> 00:31:31,599
You're exhausted.

354
00:31:31,599 --> 00:31:32,420
Eat something first.

355
00:31:37,519 --> 00:31:39,059
Yu Changxuan sent you

356
00:31:39,059 --> 00:31:40,220
to guard my house?

357
00:31:44,799 --> 00:31:46,099
He's just looking out for you.

358
00:32:02,079 --> 00:32:02,839
Miss Ye,

359
00:32:04,019 --> 00:32:05,400
if he wants something,

360
00:32:06,559 --> 00:32:07,599
he always gets it.

361
00:32:11,180 --> 00:32:12,480
Let me know if you need me.

362
00:32:28,339 --> 00:32:28,960
Wanzhi.

363
00:32:30,400 --> 00:32:31,140
Wanzhi.

364
00:32:31,839 --> 00:32:33,119
I'm sorry.

365
00:32:34,279 --> 00:32:35,480
I'm so sorry.

366
00:32:36,599 --> 00:32:38,339
Xueting. Xueting.

367
00:32:38,799 --> 00:32:40,140
Please be safe.

368
00:32:40,440 --> 00:32:41,099
Xueting.

369
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:48,619
I'll rent

370
00:32:48,940 --> 00:32:50,359
a small villa with a huge courtyard

371
00:32:51,420 --> 00:32:52,740
and great light.

372
00:32:53,240 --> 00:32:53,859
That way

373
00:32:54,259 --> 00:32:55,339
your mother can sit

374
00:32:55,339 --> 00:32:56,799
in the sun every day.

375
00:32:57,200 --> 00:32:57,819
And you

376
00:32:58,980 --> 00:33:00,140
can fill the yard with

377
00:33:00,980 --> 00:33:02,519
your favorite plantain lilies.

378
00:33:57,059 --> 00:33:58,059
Go on, get her!

379
00:35:04,800 --> 00:35:05,280
Open up.

380
00:35:09,300 --> 00:35:09,760
Get in.

381
00:35:40,219 --> 00:35:41,480
After Jiang Xueting came in,

382
00:35:41,519 --> 00:35:42,679
he asked the guard for a few books.

383
00:35:43,239 --> 00:35:44,539
I figured it was harmless, so I agreed.

384
00:35:45,400 --> 00:35:46,199
You know what,

385
00:35:46,619 --> 00:35:47,840
there are three kinds of people here.

386
00:35:48,739 --> 00:35:49,159
Either they're

387
00:35:49,300 --> 00:35:50,440
wailing and begging,

388
00:35:50,739 --> 00:35:52,199
or they're toughing it out,

389
00:35:52,199 --> 00:35:53,760
or they just want to die.

390
00:35:54,239 --> 00:35:55,539
I've never seen

391
00:35:55,659 --> 00:35:56,599
anyone like him,

392
00:35:56,860 --> 00:35:57,880
reading books in here.

393
00:35:58,739 --> 00:35:59,860
Gotta hand it to him.

394
00:36:00,239 --> 00:36:02,940
He doesn't even flinch when facing death.

395
00:36:03,579 --> 00:36:05,400
He's no ordinary man indeed.

396
00:36:06,320 --> 00:36:07,980
What a pity he leaked military secrets

397
00:36:08,239 --> 00:36:09,679
and defected to the enemy.

398
00:36:09,679 --> 00:36:11,360
Even if heaven itself

399
00:36:11,559 --> 00:36:12,840
couldn't save him now.

400
00:36:32,420 --> 00:36:33,079
Miss Ye.

401
00:36:33,840 --> 00:36:35,980
Your mother's lungs are already fragile.

402
00:36:36,900 --> 00:36:38,300
She needs absolute quiet and rest.

403
00:36:38,920 --> 00:36:40,260
And she must stay calm.

404
00:36:41,159 --> 00:36:41,719
Otherwise,

405
00:36:42,059 --> 00:36:43,199
no any doctor

406
00:36:43,420 --> 00:36:44,420
can save her.

407
00:37:05,900 --> 00:37:06,519
Pingjun,

408
00:37:07,119 --> 00:37:08,480
You're a smart girl.

409
00:37:08,940 --> 00:37:09,599
Look,

410
00:37:10,179 --> 00:37:11,440
in Nanhuai City,

411
00:37:11,860 --> 00:37:13,159
is there anything

412
00:37:13,539 --> 00:37:15,039
Changxuan can't get?

413
00:37:16,019 --> 00:37:17,860
He's the golden boy.

414
00:37:18,400 --> 00:37:19,699
You keep resisting,

415
00:37:19,739 --> 00:37:21,340
and in the end, it's your brother

416
00:37:21,699 --> 00:37:23,079
who pays the price.

417
00:37:25,340 --> 00:37:26,059
Right now,

418
00:37:26,719 --> 00:37:28,239
there's no running.

419
00:37:29,039 --> 00:37:30,860
You might as well be with him.

420
00:37:31,300 --> 00:37:32,440
In a few years,

421
00:37:32,699 --> 00:37:33,900
when he lets you go,

422
00:37:34,019 --> 00:37:35,440
you'll still be young.

423
00:37:35,940 --> 00:37:37,440
He won't shortchange

424
00:37:37,699 --> 00:37:39,380
you with money.

425
00:37:40,440 --> 00:37:42,440
Do the math.

426
00:37:44,980 --> 00:37:45,820
Besides,

427
00:37:45,940 --> 00:37:47,119
Jiang Xueting is still

428
00:37:47,260 --> 00:37:48,579
waiting on you to save his life.

429
00:37:49,400 --> 00:37:50,139
Pingjun,

430
00:37:50,619 --> 00:37:52,440
time's ticking.

431
00:38:51,679 --> 00:38:52,480
Pingjun,

432
00:38:57,480 --> 00:38:58,480
what's wrong?

433
00:39:10,300 --> 00:39:10,980
Mother,

434
00:39:12,159 --> 00:39:13,480
I have good news.

435
00:39:14,480 --> 00:39:15,639
Hanzhi's father

436
00:39:15,639 --> 00:39:16,880
found a friend.

437
00:39:18,079 --> 00:39:19,800
I'll be gone for a while.

438
00:39:20,619 --> 00:39:21,360
I'll beg him to

439
00:39:21,800 --> 00:39:23,219
let Xueting out.

440
00:39:25,260 --> 00:39:25,980
Really?

441
00:39:27,900 --> 00:39:29,579
Will he really help?

442
00:39:31,079 --> 00:39:31,980
Don't worry.

443
00:39:32,639 --> 00:39:33,480
Xueting will

444
00:39:33,480 --> 00:39:34,800
come back safe and sound.

445
00:40:06,880 --> 00:40:07,639
Miss Ye.

446
00:40:09,820 --> 00:40:10,639
Director Gu.

447
00:40:16,500 --> 00:40:18,619
Please take me to see Young Master Changxuan.

448
00:41:27,780 --> 00:41:28,579
Finally came around?

449
00:41:30,079 --> 00:41:31,300
I'm here, aren't I?

450
00:41:32,119 --> 00:41:33,599
When are you releasing Jiang Xueting?

451
00:41:38,980 --> 00:41:40,480
Releasing a suspect like him

452
00:41:40,940 --> 00:41:42,019
isn't that simple.

453
00:41:42,940 --> 00:41:43,980
The evidence is solid.

454
00:41:44,679 --> 00:41:46,019
Procedures have to be followed.

455
00:41:47,119 --> 00:41:49,019
But I will keep my word.

456
00:41:50,760 --> 00:41:52,019
He'll come back alive.

457
00:41:55,179 --> 00:41:55,900
Good.

458
00:41:57,599 --> 00:41:58,599
Then let's begin.
